# Design Patterns

## Layout Principles

### No Cards - Flat Design
- **DO NOT** use Card components for content sections
- Use subtle `<Separator />` components to divide sections
- Content flows naturally without box boundaries
- Creates a cleaner, more modern appearance

### Content Centering
- Use `max-w-2xl mx-auto` for form pages and profile-like content
- Use `max-w-3xl mx-auto` for wider content pages

### Section Structure
```vue
<section>
  <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
    <h3 class="text-sm font-medium text-muted-foreground flex items-center gap-2">
      <Icon class="h-4 w-4" />
      {{ title }}
    </h3>
    <Button variant="ghost" size="icon" @click="handleAction">
      <Pencil class="h-4 w-4" />
    </Button>
  </div>
  <!-- Section content -->
</section>

<Separator class="my-8" />
```

## Button Consistency

### All Action Buttons
- **ALL buttons use `variant="outline"`** - No solid/filled buttons
- This creates a cohesive, modern, minimal appearance
- Icons inside buttons should match the action (filled icons for Start/Stop)

### Edit/Action Buttons in Sections
- Use `variant="ghost" size="icon"` for section edit buttons
- Position on the right side of section headers
- Use Pencil icon for edit actions

### Form Submit Buttons
- Primary action: `<Button type="submit" variant="outline">{{ label }}</Button>`
- Cancel action: `<Button type="button" variant="outline">{{ label }}</Button>`
- Position: `<div class="flex justify-end gap-3">`

## Form Design

### Sheet-based Editing
- Use Sheet components for edit forms, not inline editing
- Separate sheets for different data domains (personal, operator, security)
- Sheet max-width: `sm:max-w-md`
- Sheet padding: `px-6`

### Form Layout
```vue
<form @submit.prevent="handleSubmit" class="mt-8 space-y-6">
  <div class="space-y-2">
    <Label for="fieldId">{{ label }}</Label>
    <Input id="fieldId" v-model="value" />
    <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">{{ hint }}</p>
  </div>
  
  <div class="flex justify-end gap-3 pt-4">
    <Button type="button" variant="outline">Cancel</Button>
    <Button type="submit">Save</Button>
  </div>
</form>
```

## Auth Pages (Login, Register, etc.)

### Split Layout
- Left side: Branding (desktop only, `lg:flex lg:w-1/2`)
- Right side: Form content
- Use `AuthLayout` component for consistency

### Form Container
- Centered content: `flex items-center justify-center`
- Max width for form: `max-w-sm w-full`
- No cards around forms - flat design

## Loading States

### Skeleton Loading
```vue
<div class="animate-pulse space-y-4">
  <div class="h-8 w-32 bg-muted rounded" />
  <div class="h-4 w-48 bg-muted rounded" />
</div>
```

## Typography in Sections

- Section title: `text-sm font-medium text-muted-foreground`
- Field label: `text-xs text-muted-foreground`
- Field value: `font-medium`
- Descriptions: `text-sm text-muted-foreground`
